The [[Carrot]] is a rare [[Food]] available in the shop for [[Ranger]]s. It occasionally cleanses a debuff, and if the character has enough {{icon/luck}} it has a chance to grant an {{icon/empower}}.

Two [[Carrot]]s can combine with a [[Goobert]] to give a [[Carrot Goobert]], which has debuff cleansing and {{icon/empower}}-granting effects, although unlike most [[Goobert]]s, it doesn't heal or block whatsoever.

A [[Carrot]], [[Snowball]], and [[Lump of Coal]] can combine into a [[Snowmaster]], which is a powerful {{icon/cold}}-inflicting and {{icon/empower}}-gaining [[pet]].


